    "text": "countryherald.com\nwebsite\nPaducah\nKentucky Weather Update: Thunderstorms May Disrupt Paducah Commute After 1 p.m. Thursday — Weekend Heat Builds to 94°\nBy County Herald Weather Center,\n20 hours agoPaducah, Kentucky – Triple-digit heat index values and scattered afternoon thunderstorms will challenge outdoor plans across western Kentucky starting Thursday, July 10, and intensifying through the weekend. Thursday marks the beginning of a multi-day summer weather alert with afternoon storms and rising temperatures — pushing highs near 94° by Saturday.\n1",
